//
// Tutorial 6 — Velocity (dynamics)
//
// (vel:N) sets the volume/intensity (0-127).
// As a rule suffix, it wraps the whole rule (start/end pair).
//
// Try: change the values and listen to the difference.

@core
@alphabet.western:audio

-----
S -> Soft Loud Soft

Soft -> C4 E4 G4 E4 (vel:40)
Loud -> F4 A4 C5 A4 (vel:110)
